  "packageHash": "GG0zUVQ5FOxKcG/RL05+4Cvg/gYJmVnqqI3kPFhHgcU5wy+WJOF4pftCjnYAPQ7UZOixqRIPri8brnG28wS4/w==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 31082,
  "published": "2026-02-26T06:17:32.48Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.0.1\n\t\t\t- Initial release of the Dynamic Tab Application Framework.\n\t\t\t- Introduced metadata-driven and configurable tab generation.\n\t\t\t- Implemented RBAC-based tab visibility and behavior control.\n\t\t\t- Enabled support for multiple tab design and layout variations.\n\t\t\t- Designed using Clean Architecture and Ports and Adapters principles.\n\t\t\t- Added extensibility for integration with enterprise systems and adapters.",
